{"availability":"available","full":"YearsAlso/zoo-framework","name":"zoo-framework","description":"In-process task orchestration for Python: scheduled, observable, stateful — no broker, no cron daemon.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2023-06-07T12:53:36Z","updated":"2026-10-18T13:06:53Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yearsalso.github.io/zoo-framework/","topics":["agent","ai-agents","asyncio","background-jobs","concurrency","event-driven","framework","job-scheduler","llm","multithreading","no-dependencies","pypi","python","python3","scheduler","state-machine","task-orchestration","task-scheduler","threading","workflow-engine"],"demo":"https://yearsalso.github.io/zoo-framework/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T06:18:27.932Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T06:18:27.932Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T06:18:27.932Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:05:49.612Z","stars":1,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:39:42.390Z","stars":1,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-19T06:18:27.932Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Python declarative multi-task orchestration framework powering next-gen Agents and workflows","Zoo Framework runs long-lived background tasks in-process — no broker (no Redis / RabbitMQ), no distributed setup, designed so that AI-agent-generated code can drive it: a narrow extension surface, loud failures, and a spec baseline an agent can verify by running tests.","It is for developers who need scheduled, observable, persistent background work embedded in their own process — the in-process alternative to Celery, not a replacement for it."],"features":["Events are isolated per channel; an event can select its response mechanism (first responder only / by priority / all / a named responder). Reactor registration is idempotent — registering the same object twice does not…","State is persisted periodically by StateMachineWorker and once more on shutdown: written to a .tmp file then atomically replaced, keeping the last 5 backups in a sibling backups/ directory.","--create fails and exits if the target directory already exists — it does not","merge and does not overwrite. Check for the directory yourself if you need idempotency in a script.","--worker names must be valid Python identifiers: no leading digit, no hyphens, dots"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearsAlso/zoo-framework/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"91a66c792e5d427c122a5a8660babb7e6dcebfe4fa87403d19565b087a7ed46c","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:42.516Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:42.516Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Python declarative multi-task orchestration framework powering next-gen Agents and workflows","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearsAlso/zoo-framework/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"91a66c792e5d427c122a5a8660babb7e6dcebfe4fa87403d19565b087a7ed46c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearsAlso/zoo-framework/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:42.516Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-13T06:30:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YearsAlso/zoo-framework/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:42.517Z","hash":"91a66c792e5d427c122a5a8660babb7e6dcebfe4fa87403d19565b087a7ed46c","originalBytes":27354,"storedBytes":27354,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T06:39:42.390Z","subjects":["Automation & workflows","MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Productivity","subjects":["Automation & workflows","MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Automation & workflows","source":"metadata","match":"workflow"},{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"agent"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":[],"reviewRe